{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/226","id":4827893845,"node_id":"PR_kwDORoMukM8AAAABH8PQVQ","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/226","diff_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/226.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/226.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/226","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/226/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/226/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/226/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/statuses/72cdd08ed8d5a6665e2cedd5f3f2ed5c6dd06ab8","number":226,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(marketplace): add complete HTML Guide Kit (PR2)","user":{"login":"ranzuozhou","id":35538471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTM4NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35538471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou","html_url":"https://github.com/ranzuozhou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 变更摘要\n\n新增 HTML Guide Kit 0.1.0 完整开发插件：显式调用 $html-guide-kit:guide 后读取材料，提出不同的读者／任务／理解问题并等待明确确认，随后在聊天交付新指南文本。完整包、两份参考、Owner 已选第二轮 A「HTML教材」图标、登记与严格安装合同在同一 PR 接入。\n\nRefs: #217, #219\n\n## 影响范围\n\n- develop 净新增一个 Read 插件与一个显式公开技能，合计四插件／五公开技能；自然启用三项，20 开发技能仅仓库作用域。\n- marketplace 未发布 8.1.2 和 Diagram 0.3.1／Understanding 0.1.2／Explain 0.1.1 保持。本任务不创建 Release、发布标签或 main 发布 PR。\n- manifest、图标、SKILL、原生配置和必需参考按 raw bytes／SHA-256 严格核验，拒绝缺失、额外 guide 资源、错版本及借用链接；HTML示例提示每项≤128字符，避免baseline忽略入口。\n- 保留原四安装场景，增加 HTML 单独／HTML＋Explain／全四插件。同步当前文档、INDEX、AGENTS、CHANGELOG、品牌导出与实际32/48/64深浅预览，family布局扩行。\n\n## 已验证内容\n\n行为候选 `1cd0f1c2a9395fd192260d06778e8489182516a8`，当前 head `72cdd08ed8d5a6665e2cedd5f3f2ed5c6dd06ab8`；两者全部62个插件分发文件raw字节相同，纯评审资料新增保持0.1.0。基于PR1实际merge70267a5，未修改用户main/develop工作区或研究项目。\n\n- npm test：279/279 PASS、0 skip（实际PowerShell/Python）；validate／check／smoke通过，CLI0.147.0。\n- 七种canonical安装全部通过，四个含Diagram场景实际缓存Python扫描1/FAIL0/WARN0；当前head的完整严格七安装复验也已通过，原始结果分片保存在本PR评论（解码后SHA-256 39c0133eafbb15037c161e80049b4ca01f6e25eba9ff9708f476d220a1e518c7）。\n- 六组关键行为B1–B6、14指定fresh变体、30连续轮次逐项独立PASS，准确UUID／输入输出／工具事件／模型身份及source-mirror-cache raw哈希全部保存。运行模型来自baseline实际model/list默认gpt-5.6-sol/low，用户原模型配置未改。\n- 原始不支持模型调用保留INVALID_RUN；额外修订fresh尝试与原UNKNOWN分开；实际运输完成为15个模型会话31轮，不能称15个PASS会话或31个PASS轮次。工具拒绝、后台同步／长路径／网络重试均保留。\n- native实际SKILL附件有准确cache locator及完整body字节对应，单列为native_skill_attachment，不伪装shell读取。首版范围拒绝阶段未读取的参考为有依据NOT_APPLICABLE，不扩充资料理解覆盖。\n\n[RUNBOOK](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/html-guide-package/docs/runbook/%5BRUNBOOK%5D_HTML_Guide_Kit_Acceptance.md)、[行为汇总](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/html-guide-package/docs/runbook/evidence/html-guide-kit/pr2-behavior-summary.json)、[原始证据索引](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/html-guide-package/docs/runbook/evidence/html-guide-kit/pr2-reviewer/final/index.json) 可复核。247原文件lossless封装，全部恢复raw字节／SHA及独立复核通过；不含认证、临时home或原用户会话。评审镜像排除控制/答案/评审文档，不要求其tree等于完整canonical。\n\n## Draft与合并门槛\n\nDraft用于完整工程候选和六组阻断行为准备；这两项已完成。当前head严格安装与CI复验均已通过，现转ready供独立审查。\n\n**合并条件保持严格**：当前head实际CI、非作者批准、最后push批准、已解决审查线程、最新develop且无冲突；不bypass，不用多代理评审替代GitHub批准。实际merge复验后才显式关闭#219。\n\n- [x] 完整包／严格资源／七安装／实际Python\n- [x] 六组真实连续行为／独立逐项评审\n- [x] 来源／镜像／缓存／会话证据及历史失败分离\n- [x] 当前head最终完整canonical七安装／四次实际Python复验\n- [x] 当前head实际CI（A6／结构／Ubuntu／Windows）\n- [ ] 当前head GitHub非作者／最后push批准（合并门禁）\n\n## 剩余验收及限制\n\nPR3仍从本阶段实际合并后的最新develop派生，完成受众／篇幅／背景／完整演示／限制路径扩展、Codex应用UI与ChatGPT桌面真实交互、宿主生命周期及最终merge复验。B5.2有轻微来源归属措辞note：额外读者／任务检查轴被统括为原文明确列项；未编造效果或评分，冻结该项判准通过，note原样保留供扩展复核。此批有限CLI样本不证明全部输出或UI通过。\n\nOwner已决定现实学习效果另测，effect_status=NOT_MEASURED。#220和Epic#217保持开放，不提前关闭或追认历史PASS。\n\n## 自检结果\n\n- [x] plugin.json完整，Read唯一入口及原子登记\n- [x] SKILL严格YAML，原生allow_implicit_invocation=false与资源精确集合\n- [x] 文档合规，INDEX／根AGENTS／CHANGELOG同步\n- [x] 运行包无本机研究目录、聊天ID、密码或Token\n- [x] 无残留调试代码或被测模型可访问的评审控制\n- [x] 六提交convention校验通过，均Refs #217／#219\n- [x] 已选图标及尺寸／深浅预览完整\n\n## 回退\n\n通过新PR原子撤销插件包、登记与对应runtime合同并保留历史证据。首次修改已合并运行资源从0.1.0推进补丁；纯评审记录证明运行字节未变。本任务没有正式发布操作。\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-12T10:07:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:25:51Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T11:25:49Z","merged_at":"2026-10-12T11:25:49Z","merge_commit_sha":"d106e76651d53cdf3f0cef2bb33ce47e8d7fda38","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MJ-AgentLab:codex/html-guide-package","ref":"codex/html-guide-package","repo":{"id":1183002256,"node_id":"R_kgDORoMukA","name":"mj-agentlab-marketplace","full_name":"MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace","owner":{"login":"MJ-AgentLab","id":262496159,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6Vfnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262496159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab","followers_url":"https